  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "31197392",
      "title": "Adding a Modal Screen",
      "lectureOrder": 33,
      "videoOrder": 30,
      "sourceHash": "1fc3c18e576b80417d753ce50fd5279ed1d5b14b8365745408720db74c781deb",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.134,
          "end": 2.967,
          "en": "[Maximilian Schwarzmüller] So again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.967,
          "end": 5.23,
          "en": "We made good progress here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.23,
          "end": 8.01,
          "en": "To conclude this section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.01,
          "end": 9.58,
          "en": "I wanna improve the overall look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.58,
          "end": 13.12,
          "en": "and feel of this application a little bit though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.12,
          "end": 17.66,
          "en": "And I wanna start by actually outsourcing this input part",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.66,
          "end": 21.04,
          "en": "into a modal, modals are these overlays.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.04,
          "end": 23.6,
          "en": "That typically slide up or pop up,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.6,
          "end": 27.23,
          "en": "on mobile apps that overlay the main screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.23,
          "end": 28.92,
          "en": "And allow you to take some action,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.92,
          "end": 31.3,
          "en": "after which they disappear.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.3,
          "end": 35.75,
          "en": "Adding such a modal, and adding the input logic here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.75,
          "end": 37,
          "en": "into such a model,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37,
          "end": 40.35,
          "en": "is thankfully pretty easy in React Native.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.35,
          "end": 43.593,
          "en": "Because it comes with a built in modal component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.54,
          "end": 47.46,
          "en": "So, all you have to do in the goal input component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.46,
          "end": 49.53,
          "en": "where I want to create that modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.53,
          "end": 53.47,
          "en": "Is, you import modal from React Native.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 53.47,
          "end": 55.6,
          "en": "And then you wrap that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.6,
          "end": 59.37,
          "en": "around the content that should go into the modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.37,
          "end": 60.81,
          "en": "In my case here, that's the view",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 60.81,
          "end": 62.563,
          "en": "with the text input and the button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 63.65,
          "end": 67.93,
          "en": "If you do that, we have this look here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 67.93,
          "end": 70.31,
          "en": "So our list of goals seems to be gone",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.31,
          "end": 72.28,
          "en": "and the styling is a bit off.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 72.28,
          "end": 75.89,
          "en": "And as I add goals, I don't see them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 75.89,
          "end": 76.91,
          "en": "The reason for that is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 76.91,
          "end": 78.93,
          "en": "that we actually see the modal here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 78.93,
          "end": 82.26,
          "en": "The overlay, which we have on the entire screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 82.26,
          "end": 85.49,
          "en": "Now, of course the modal shouldn't always be there though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 85.49,
          "end": 87.34,
          "en": "Instead it would be nice to have a button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 87.34,
          "end": 88.86,
          "en": "on the start screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 88.86,
          "end": 90.74,
          "en": "that allows us to open the modal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 90.74,
          "end": 92.69,
          "en": "when we want to add a new goal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 92.69,
          "end": 94.82,
          "en": "And then to have a button that allows us to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 94.82,
          "end": 97.93299999999999,
          "en": "close this modal here on this modal screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 99.14,
          "end": 100.75,
          "en": "Now let's start with that button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 100.75,
          "end": 103.03,
          "en": "that opens the modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 103.03,
          "end": 105.83,
          "en": "For this, I'll go back to App.js,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 105.83,
          "end": 108.205,
          "en": "and I want to add that button there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 108.205,
          "end": 110.336,
          "en": "We still have the goal input component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 110.336,
          "end": 113.92,
          "en": "But above that component, I wanna add a button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 113.92,
          "end": 118.3,
          "en": "And for this I'll use the good old built in button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 118.3,
          "end": 121.44,
          "en": "Though, of course we could also import \"pressable\".",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 121.44,
          "end": 122.87,
          "en": "And build our own button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 122.87,
          "end": 125.03,
          "en": "as you learned it a couple of minutes ago.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 125.03,
          "end": 127.76,
          "en": "Because the button here in the end, all it just",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 127.76,
          "end": 131.63,
          "en": "uses is the \"pressable\" component or those old \"touchable\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 131.63,
          "end": 133.55,
          "en": "components internally.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 133.55,
          "end": 134.84,
          "en": "But here, to save some time,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 134.84,
          "end": 138.32,
          "en": "I'll use the prebuilt button instead of building my own one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 138.32,
          "end": 142.977,
          "en": "And I'll give this button a title off, \"add new goal\".",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 144.06,
          "end": 147.8,
          "en": "I'll also give the button a color, through the color prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 147.8,
          "end": 151.04,
          "en": "Because \"button\" doesn't take a style prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 151.04,
          "end": 152.7,
          "en": "It doesn't support it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 152.7,
          "end": 154.74,
          "en": "Because it is already pre-styled.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 154.74,
          "end": 157.36,
          "en": "That's why you can't influence it too much.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 157.36,
          "end": 160.5,
          "en": "If you do want to style your own button, you have to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 160.5,
          "end": 163.21,
          "en": "build your own button with the \"pressable\" component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 163.21,
          "end": 165.963,
          "en": "And then some text and views inside of it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 167.2,
          "end": 169.81,
          "en": "Here, with the pre-built button, we can change the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 169.81,
          "end": 172.3,
          "en": "color through the color prop though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 172.3,
          "end": 175.22,
          "en": "And I will set color here to,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 175.22,
          "end": 176.743,
          "en": "actually to a string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 178.2,
          "end": 180.8,
          "en": "And I will use the same purple,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 180.8,
          "end": 183.7,
          "en": "as I used here in goal item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 183.7,
          "end": 186.04,
          "en": "For the background of my goals.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 186.04,
          "end": 188.243,
          "en": "I'll use this purple color here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 189.1,
          "end": 193.573,
          "en": "And set this as a color of this button here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 194.5,
          "end": 195.333,
          "en": "Like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 196.61,
          "end": 197.97,
          "en": "So now we have the button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 197.97,
          "end": 200.28,
          "en": "But of course, we don't see the button if",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 200.28,
          "end": 201.113,
          "en": "we save this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 201.113,
          "end": 203.92000000000002,
          "en": "Because we still have the modal everywhere.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 203.92000000000002,
          "end": 207.57999999999998,
          "en": "Now this button should control the modal visibility.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 207.57999999999998,
          "end": 209.15,
          "en": "And for this we need \"state\",",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 209.15,
          "end": 212.35,
          "en": "because the modal should either be visible or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 212.35,
          "end": 215.92000000000002,
          "en": "And that's a typical case for using \"state\".",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 215.92000000000002,
          "end": 217.15,
          "en": "So, here in the app component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 217.15,
          "end": 220.11,
          "en": "we can add a new piece of \"state\".",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 220.11,
          "end": 223.26,
          "en": "And use, \"use state\" to initialize it and set it to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 223.26,
          "end": 224.24,
          "en": "false initially,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 224.24,
          "end": 228.97,
          "en": "because that will be my \"modal is visible\" state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 230.12,
          "end": 233.84,
          "en": "And the \"set modal is visible\" updating function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 233.84,
          "end": 235.89,
          "en": "will allow me to change it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 235.89,
          "end": 238.93,
          "en": "And initially the modal should not be visible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 238.93,
          "end": 242.16,
          "en": "Now we wanna change this whenever the button is clicked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 242.16,
          "end": 244.76,
          "en": "So for this, I'll add a \"function\" here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 244.76,
          "end": 247.573,
          "en": "maybe here, the exact position doesn't matter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 248.62,
          "end": 253.387,
          "en": "Which I will name \"start at goal handler\".",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 254.43,
          "end": 256.927,
          "en": "And in this function I want to set,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 256.927,
          "end": 258.82,
          "en": "\"set modal is visible\" to true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 258.82,
          "end": 261.5,
          "en": "Because I wanna show the modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 261.5,
          "end": 263.97,
          "en": "Now, this \"start at goal handler\" function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 263.97,
          "end": 266.15,
          "en": "should now be connected to this button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 266.15,
          "end": 267.29,
          "en": "And this button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 267.29,
          "end": 270.96,
          "en": "being a built in component has this on press prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 270.96,
          "end": 275.22,
          "en": "Which we now use to connect it to \"start at goal handler\".",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 275.22,
          "end": 279.86,
          "en": "Now to show the modal only when this state is true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 279.86,
          "end": 283.40999999999997,
          "en": "We could now render goal input conditionally,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 283.40999999999997,
          "end": 286.69,
          "en": "as we would do a it in most React Web Apps.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 286.69,
          "end": 289.12,
          "en": "We can add curly braces around that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 289.12,
          "end": 291.94,
          "en": "And then check our \"modal is visible\" state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 291.94,
          "end": 293.1,
          "en": "And if it's true,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 293.1,
          "end": 295.04,
          "en": "then we render goal input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 295.04,
          "end": 298.323,
          "en": "Which internally contains this modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 300.56,
          "end": 302.923,
          "en": "If we do It like this and we save everything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 303.78,
          "end": 305.58,
          "en": "Indeed we see the button here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 305.58,
          "end": 307.09,
          "en": "And if I press the button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 307.09,
          "end": 308.97,
          "en": "the modal appears",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 308.97,
          "end": 310.96,
          "en": "But the model then is just there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 310.96,
          "end": 313.17,
          "en": "There is no animation and nothing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 313.17,
          "end": 315.157,
          "en": "And therefore that's typically not,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 315.157,
          "end": 316.323,
          "en": "how you would do that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 317.39,
          "end": 321.44,
          "en": "Instead of just showing or hiding this component like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 321.44,
          "end": 326.03,
          "en": "A better approach is to embrace some of the props, \"modal\".",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 326.03,
          "end": 329.023,
          "en": "This built-in modal component, offers to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 329.87,
          "end": 334.13,
          "en": "To be precise, this \"modal\" component has a \"visible\" prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 334.13,
          "end": 336.15999999999997,
          "en": "And if set to \"true\", the model is visible,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 336.15999999999997,
          "end": 337.883,
          "en": "If set to \"false\", it's not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 339,
          "end": 340.87,
          "en": "Now, this is useful.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 340.87,
          "end": 345.87,
          "en": "Because in addition, modal also has a animation type prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 346.7,
          "end": 349.74,
          "en": "Where you can set how it will be animated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 349.74,
          "end": 352.73,
          "en": "That there maybe is no animation at all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 352.73,
          "end": 354.35,
          "en": "That it should fade.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 354.35,
          "end": 356.6,
          "en": "Or that it should slide in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 356.6,
          "end": 358.363,
          "en": "And I will go for sliding.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 359.25,
          "end": 361.437,
          "en": "And now I just expect to get the,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 361.437,
          "end": 365.503,
          "en": "\"should it be displayed or not\" information, via props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 366.36,
          "end": 369.22,
          "en": "So here I'll access \"props.visible\",",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 369.22,
          "end": 372.04,
          "en": "though this prop name here is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 372.04,
          "end": 374.017,
          "en": "It could also be \"show modal\".",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 374.92,
          "end": 378.09,
          "en": "But I'll choose \"visible\".",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 378.09,
          "end": 381.24,
          "en": "And now we have to set this prop on goal input,",
          "zh": ""
